{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-82114","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-146249","text":"locu.systems"}]},{"id":"blk-82115","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-146250","marks":["bold"],"text":"Direction, ruled 2026-09-14: a host for ComputeDriven loci."},{"id":"spn-146251","text":" The customer deploys a "},{"id":"spn-146252","marks":["bold"],"text":"locus"},{"id":"spn-146253","text":" — the thing that carries state, granted authority and continuity across restarts. The machine under it is a "},{"id":"spn-146254","marks":["bold"],"text":"carrier"},{"id":"spn-146255","text":": rented, replaceable, never the customer's identity. The meter counts "},{"id":"spn-146256","marks":["bold"],"text":"admitted transitions"},{"id":"spn-146257","text":"; utilization is printed everywhere and billed nowhere. The record is "},{"id":"spn-146258","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/90_LOCUS_HOSTING.md"},{"id":"spn-146259","text":". "},{"id":"spn-146260","marks":["bold"],"text":"Nothing in it is built."}]},{"id":"blk-82116","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-146261","marks":["bold"],"text":"The rename is DONE, except the directory. Ruled and executed 2026-09-14."}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-82118","spans":[{"id":"spn-146262","text":"thing"}]},{"id":"blk-82119","spans":[{"id":"spn-146263","text":"was"}]},{"id":"blk-82120","spans":[{"id":"spn-146264","text":"is"}]}],"id":"blk-82117","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-82121","spans":[{"id":"spn-146265","text":"domain"}]},{"id":"blk-82122","spans":[{"id":"spn-146266","text":"webhost.systems"}]},{"id":"blk-82123","spans":[{"id":"spn-146267","marks":["bold"],"text":"locu.systems"}]}],[{"id":"blk-82124","spans":[{"id":"spn-146268","text":"GitHub repo"}]},{"id":"blk-82125","spans":[{"id":"spn-146269","marks":["code"],"text":"c-u-l8er/WebHost.Systems"}]},{"id":"blk-82126","spans":[{"id":"spn-146270","marks":["bold"],"text":"`c-u-l8er/locu.systems`"}]}],[{"id":"blk-82127","spans":[{"id":"spn-146271","text":"nav property key"}]},{"id":"blk-82128","spans":[{"id":"spn-146272","marks":["code"],"text":"webhost"}]},{"id":"blk-82129","spans":[{"id":"spn-146273","marks":["bold"],"text":"`locu`"},{"id":"spn-146274","text":" (amp-nav v0.13.0)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-82130","spans":[{"id":"spn-146275","marks":["bold"],"text":"this directory"}]},{"id":"blk-82131","spans":[{"id":"spn-146276","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems"}]},{"id":"blk-82132","spans":[{"id":"spn-146277","marks":["bold"],"text":"`WebHost.Systems` — unchanged, on purpose"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-82133","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-146278","text":"The directory keeps the old name because renaming it breaks the root "},{"id":"spn-146279","marks":["code"],"text":"CLAUDE.md"},{"id":"spn-146280","text":", "},{"id":"spn-146281","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/launch.json"},{"id":"spn-146282","text":", "},{"id":"spn-146283","marks":["code"],"text":"sync-nav.sh"},{"id":"spn-146284","text":"'s "},{"id":"spn-146285","marks":["code"],"text":"EXTRA_TARGETS"},{"id":"spn-146286","text":" and any parallel session holding this tree open. "},{"id":"spn-146287","marks":["bold"],"text":"It is now the only place the old name survives by design"},{"id":"spn-146288","text":" — if you find the old name anywhere else, it is stale."}]},{"id":"blk-82134","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-146289","text":"The nav divergence this file used to describe is "},{"id":"spn-146290","marks":["bold"],"text":"retired"},{"id":"spn-146291","text":": lane N's source was edited in the same pass, so the menu now says "},{"id":"spn-146292","marks":["code"],"text":"locu.systems"},{"id":"spn-146293","text":", tags it "},{"id":"spn-146294","marks":["italic"],"text":"\"A host for ComputeDriven loci\""},{"id":"spn-146295","text":" and links the new domain. The page's divergence block is gone with it. "},{"id":"spn-146296","marks":["code"],"text":"launch-gate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-146297","text":" still refuses in the other direction — if a vendored "},{"id":"spn-146298","marks":["code"],"text":"amp-nav.js"},{"id":"spn-146299","text":" ever carries the previous URL again while nothing is declared in the record, it will not publish."}]},{"id":"blk-82135","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-146300","marks":["bold"],"text":"There is no placement band, and that is a declared divergence from `agents/SHELL.md` §1"},{"id":"spn-146301","text":" (ruled 2026-09-14 — four stacked bars above the masthead). Its rung chip and the sentence bounding what that rung covers moved into the status block. "},{"id":"spn-146302","marks":["bold"],"text":"Removing it un-suppressed `amp-nav`'s own placement strip"},{"id":"spn-146303","text":": "},{"id":"spn-146304","marks":["code"],"text":"BAND_NAME()"},{"id":"spn-146305","text":" draws one whenever the host page has no "},{"id":"spn-146306","marks":["code"],"text":".band"},{"id":"spn-146307","text":", and that version carries the "},{"id":"spn-146308","marks":["italic"],"text":"previous"},{"id":"spn-146309","text":" name and no "},{"id":"spn-146310","marks":["code"],"text":"covers"},{"id":"spn-146311","text":" span, so "},{"id":"spn-146312","marks":["code"],"text":"src/shell.css"},{"id":"spn-146313","text":" hides it through the exposed "},{"id":"spn-146314","marks":["code"],"text":"place"},{"id":"spn-146315","text":" part and the "},{"id":"spn-146316","marks":["code"],"text":"<amp-nav height>"},{"id":"spn-146317","text":" attribute reserves the bar's height instead of bar-plus-strip. "},{"id":"spn-146318","marks":["code"],"text":"shell_divergence"},{"id":"spn-146319","text":" in "},{"id":"spn-146320","marks":["code"],"text":"records/surface.json"},{"id":"spn-146321","text":" records all of it and the gate enforces every half."}]},{"id":"blk-82136","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-146322","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/80_SERVICE_MANAGEMENT_PILOT.md"},{"id":"spn-146323","text":" proposed a different direction earlier the same day and is "},{"id":"spn-146324","marks":["bold"],"text":"banded, not rewritten"},{"id":"spn-146325","text":" — its phase two became this ruling."}]},{"id":"blk-82137","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-146326","text":"What is in the tree from the abandoned agent-deployment direction: a control plane for [&] Protocol agents (Postgres schema plus edge functions in the sibling "},{"id":"spn-146327","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand-supabase/"},{"id":"spn-146328","text":") and a Vite/React dashboard with a passing test suite. "},{"id":"spn-146329","marks":["bold"],"text":"None of it executes anything"},{"id":"spn-146330","text":" — the deploy path writes a version row and marks the provider reference "},{"id":"spn-146331","marks":["code"],"text":"simulated"},{"id":"spn-146332","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-82138","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-146333","text":"The marketing page is GENERATED. Do not hand-edit "},{"id":"spn-146334","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-146335","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-82139","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-146336","marks":["code"],"text":"/index.html"},{"id":"spn-146337","text":", "},{"id":"spn-146338","marks":["code"],"text":"/app.js"},{"id":"spn-146339","text":", "},{"id":"spn-146340","marks":["code"],"text":"/app.css"},{"id":"spn-146341","text":", "},{"id":"spn-146342","marks":["code"],"text":"/boot.js"},{"id":"spn-146343","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-146344","marks":["code"],"text":"/say.js"},{"id":"spn-146345","text":" are emitted by "},{"id":"spn-146346","marks":["code"],"text":"build-site.mjs"},{"id":"spn-146347","text":" from "},{"id":"spn-146348","marks":["code"],"text":"records/surface.json"},{"id":"spn-146349","text":", "},{"id":"spn-146350","marks":["code"],"text":"records/evidence.json"},{"id":"spn-146351","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-146352","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-146353","text":". "},{"id":"spn-146354","marks":["bold"],"text":"An edit to the served HTML is silently reverted by the next build."},{"id":"spn-146355","text":" Change the record or the template, then run "},{"id":"spn-146356","marks":["code"],"text":"npm run site:launch"},{"id":"spn-146357","text":", which emits the page and then runs "},{"id":"spn-146358","marks":["code"],"text":"launch-gate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-146359","text":" against the artifact. The shell is documented in "},{"id":"spn-146360","marks":["code"],"text":"ProjectAmp2/agents/SHELL.md"},{"id":"spn-146361","text":"; this surface is built against revision "},{"id":"spn-146362","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-r16"},{"id":"spn-146363","text":", recorded as "},{"id":"spn-146364","marks":["code"],"text":"shell_revision"},{"id":"spn-146365","text":" in "},{"id":"spn-146366","marks":["code"],"text":"records/surface.json"},{"id":"spn-146367","text":", and "},{"id":"spn-146368","marks":["code"],"text":"launch-gate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-146369","text":" refuses when this file and the record disagree."}]},{"id":"blk-82140","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-146370","marks":["code"],"text":"site:build"},{"id":"spn-146371","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-146372","marks":["code"],"text":"site:gate"},{"id":"spn-146373","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-146374","marks":["code"],"text":"site:launch"},{"id":"spn-146375","text":" are "},{"id":"spn-146376","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-146377","text":" wired into "},{"id":"spn-146378","marks":["code"],"text":"build"},{"id":"spn-146379","text":", "},{"id":"spn-146380","marks":["code"],"text":"dev"},{"id":"spn-146381","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-146382","marks":["code"],"text":"test"},{"id":"spn-146383","text":" — those belong to "},{"id":"spn-146384","marks":["code"],"text":"apps/web"},{"id":"spn-146385","text":", a separate artifact."}]},{"id":"blk-82141","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-146386","text":"ONE PAGE: the site and the console are the same document"}]},{"id":"blk-82142","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-146387","marks":["code"],"text":"/"},{"id":"spn-146388","text":" serves the home view; "},{"id":"spn-146389","marks":["code"],"text":"#/ops/*"},{"id":"spn-146390","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-146391","marks":["code"],"text":"#/account/*"},{"id":"spn-146392","text":" are the console and the client portal, rendered by "},{"id":"spn-146393","marks":["code"],"text":"/app.js"},{"id":"spn-146394","text":" into "},{"id":"spn-146395","marks":["code"],"text":"#app"},{"id":"spn-146396","text":". "},{"id":"spn-146397","marks":["code"],"text":"build-site.mjs"},{"id":"spn-146398","text":" emits five artifacts — "},{"id":"spn-146399","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-146400","text":", "},{"id":"spn-146401","marks":["code"],"text":"app.js"},{"id":"spn-146402","text":", "},{"id":"spn-146403","marks":["code"],"text":"app.css"},{"id":"spn-146404","text":", "},{"id":"spn-146405","marks":["code"],"text":"boot.js"},{"id":"spn-146406","text":", "},{"id":"spn-146407","marks":["code"],"text":"say.js"},{"id":"spn-146408","text":" — from "},{"id":"spn-146409","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-146410","text":" and the records. "},{"id":"spn-146411","marks":["bold"],"text":"The home view is in the served bytes and `app.js` may never author it"},{"id":"spn-146412","text":"; "},{"id":"spn-146413","marks":["code"],"text":"app.css"},{"id":"spn-146414","text":" is scoped to "},{"id":"spn-146415","marks":["code"],"text":"#app"},{"id":"spn-146416","text":" so it cannot reach it; and its palette aliases the shell's tokens so one palette paints both halves. The standing notice sits outside "},{"id":"spn-146417","marks":["code"],"text":"#app"},{"id":"spn-146418","text":". "},{"id":"spn-146419","marks":["bold"],"text":"The panel's figures are invented — do not repeat them."}]},{"id":"blk-82143","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-146420","text":"Source-of-truth spec"}]},{"id":"blk-82144","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82146","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-146421","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/00_MASTER_SPEC.md"},{"id":"spn-146422","text":" — master engineering spec (self-contained, i